{"id":1893,"level":84,"name":"Атака на короля","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p>What could be more fun in chess than attacking? When we talk about 'attacking,' we are usually talking about a direct attack against the enemy king. You go straight to your goal!</p>  <p>What can you achieve with an attack? The best thing, of course, is to succeed in immediately checkmating the opponent's king. But the opponent will naturally resist this. An attack can be repelled by placing defensive pieces in front of the king.</p>  <p>However, an attack can also have a second function. If the opponent makes an extreme effort to defend the king then other pieces may well be lost. So an attack on the king can lead not only to checkmate, but also to material gain!</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Try to attack the opponent's king. See if opportunities for material gain also arise in the cases where you do not succeed in giving checkmate right away.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"2krq3/1p4p1/p4pbn/2pp3p/8/2P1P2P/PP1QNPP1/2KR3R b - - 0 21","pgn":"21... Qe4 22. Qd3 Qxd3 23. Rxd3 Bxd3 * ","text":"","format":27},{"fen":"r1b1k2r/1p2bpp1/pq1p1np1/3P2N1/2P2B2/2N4P/PP4PK/R2QR3 b kq - 0 18","pgn":"18... Ng4+ 19. Qxg4 (19. Kh1 Nf2+ {[%csl Rd1,Gf2,Rh1][%cal Gf2d1,Gf2h1]}) (19. Kg3 Qf2#) 19... Bxg4 * ","text":"<p>Чорний означає рухатися. Ми можемо йти безпосередньо до нашої мети, давши чек коню. Білі, звичайно, не можуть взяти цього коня пішаком через пішака. Тим не менш, рахувати доведеться, тому що білі можуть захищатися кількома способами. Якщо білий король рухається по діагоналі вперед, чорні отримують мат 1, шахуючи ферзем. Якщо король рухається назад, то це ще раз перевірка з конем. Це фактично створює шахову вилку коня! Тож білим залишається лише взяти коня. Але тоді, звичайно, ми беремо ферзя з нашим шаховим епископом. Тож ми бачимо, як напад на короля може призвести до матеріальної вигоди.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"2krq3/1p4p1/p4pbn/2pp3p/8/2P1P2P/PP1QNPP1/2KR3R b - - 0 21","pgn":"21... Qe4 22. Qd3 Qxd3 23. Rxd3 Bxd3 * ","text":"","format":27},{"fen":"r1b1k2r/1p2bpp1/pq1p1np1/3P2N1/2P2B2/2N4P/PP4PK/R2QR3 b kq - 0 18","pgn":"18... Ng4+ 19. Qxg4 (19. Kh1 Nf2+ {[%csl Rd1,Gf2,Rh1][%cal Gf2d1,Gf2h1]}) (19. Kg3 Qf2#) 19... Bxg4 * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":75552,"fen":"5r1k/ppQ3pp/8/4Pn2/5pq1/P4N2/1P3PPP/3R2K1 b - - 0 25","pgn":"{[%csl Rd1,Rf3,Rg1,Rg2][%evp 0,3,-549,-555,-29999,-30000]} {Q=1} 25... Nh4 {[%csl Rd1,Rf3,Rg1,Rg2,Gg4,Gh4][%cal Gh4f3,Gg4g2]} 26. Nxh4 Qxd1# * ","format":27,"texts":["Вільні фігури пропонують тактичні можливості."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75562,"fen":"3q2k1/1p3pp1/p2p4/3NrP1Q/1P4R1/8/P1r2b1P/3R3K w - - 0 32","pgn":"{[%csl Gg4,Gh5][%evp 0,3,1526,29978,29991,29990]} {[#]} {Q=1} 32. Qh6 Qf6 33. Nxf6+ (33. Qxf6) * ","format":27,"texts":["Створіть загрозу мату."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75558,"fen":"2kr4/ppp2pp1/4q3/7Q/4pP2/P3P2P/1PP3P1/2K4R b - - 0 18","pgn":"{[%csl Gd8,Ge6][%evp 0,3,-529,-592,-29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 18... Qa2 19. Rd1 Qa1# * ","format":27,"texts":["Створіть шлюбну сітку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75565,"fen":"5rk1/rb2Qppp/p6q/1p6/8/6P1/PP2NP1P/3RR1K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gb7,Gh6]} {Q=1} 1... Qc6 2. Qxb7 Rxb7 (2... Qxb7) * ","format":27,"texts":["Create unstoppable threats."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75556,"fen":"r4rk1/6pp/p2b4/1p1p1p2/3P2b1/2PQB1Pq/PP1N1P1P/R3R1K1 b - - 0 18","pgn":"{[%csl Gd6,Gf5,Gh3][%evp 0,5,-225,-230,-243,-248,-1359,-1439]} {Q=1} 18... f4 19. Bxf4 {Q=2} Bxf4 20. gxf4  {Q=3} Qxd3 * ","format":27,"texts":["Make sure all your pieces join the attack.","Look at the horizontal pin.","Loose pieces drop off!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75557,"fen":"r6r/p4pk1/6p1/3pn3/Q3N1pq/5P2/PP1BB1P1/3R1RK1 b - - 0 21","pgn":"{[%csl Gg4,Gh4][%evp 0,3,-318,-297,-276,-305]} {Q=1}  21... g3 22. Nxg3 {Q=2} Qxa4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Increase your threats.","Зберіть якомога більше матеріалу."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75553,"fen":"r1b4r/pp2k2p/6p1/2pBp3/3PP3/3P4/PP3PqP/R2QKR2 b Q - 0 14","pgn":"{[%csl Rf1][%evp 0,3,-147,-183,-245,-258]} {Q=1} 14... Bh3 15. Qe2 {Q=2} Qxf1+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Створіть нестримну загрозу.","Зробіть нічию."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75563,"fen":"2r4k/p2q1p1p/5pr1/R1Ppp3/Q7/2P1P3/5PPP/5RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gd7,Gg6]} {Q=1} 1... Qh3 2. g3 {Q=2} Rh6 * ","format":27,"texts":["Bring extra attackers.","Створіть нестримну загрозу."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75566,"fen":"2kr1r2/1R6/p1pqp2p/P1Qp4/3N1n2/8/1PP2P2/R4K2 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gb7,Gc5]} {Q=1} 1. Qa7 Qb8 2. Qxb8# (2. Rxb8#) * ","format":27,"texts":["Створіть шлюбну сітку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75561,"fen":"6k1/2p1r1pp/4p3/2qpRP2/8/p1P3Q1/r4P1P/4R1K1 w - - 0 27","pgn":"{[%csl Ge5,Gf5,Gg3][%evp 0,5,243,231,283,281,991,1146]} {Q=1} 27. f6 Rf7 {Q=2} 28. Rxe6 Rxf6 {Q=3} 29. Rxf6 * ","format":27,"texts":["Створювати смертельні загрози.","Bring in more attackers.","A pin party!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75555,"fen":"rnbqk1nr/ppp2ppp/3b4/8/3P4/8/PPP1P1PP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 4","pgn":"{[%csl Re1,Yf2][%evp 0,5,-234,-230,-239,-224,-229,-238]} {Q=1} 4... Qh4+ 5. g3 {Q=2} Bxg3+ 6. hxg3 {Q=3} Qxh1 * ","format":27,"texts":["Without the f-pawn, the king is exposed.","Time for a pin party.","Black can win material."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]}]}